{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PNazGKvrN2fMw8P8vQmMLL","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。Claim 1 \"robust across scales and generation\n2\t  modes\" 无需 hedge。 Headline: \"Feature-based ordinal depth estimation achieves 70–85%\n3\t  four-class accuracy across 1B–14B model scales, 3 decoding strategies, and both\n4\t  unconditional and prompted generation.\" Claim 2 Atlas 自然扩展至 14B 维度，EDD 跨规模一致性成为额外的\n5\t  scientific finding。 Claim 3 两阶段 pipeline 作为 practical method contribution 成立——策略分类改进后\n6\t  predicted two-stage 优于 naive pooling，从 limitation 变为 solved problem。论文定位：task formalization\n7\t  + comprehensive Atlas + deployable pipeline。三类贡献齐全，EMNLP Main 一般 track 和 \"New Missions\"\n8\t  track 均有竞争力。\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: 13B Clean FP16 Scale Validation\n13\t  plan_id: plan_014\n14\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B FP16 + LoRA, nucleus p=0.95, d0-d3 recursive chain, 19-feature\n15\t    extraction + RF/LR classification. Pythia-1.4B as reference model.\n16\t  expected_results:\n17\t    four_class_rf_acc: 0.762\n18\t    four_class_rf_acc_ci:\n19\t    - 0.748\n20\t    - 0.776\n21\t    four_class_lr_acc: 0.731\n22\t    d0v1_auc: 0.991\n23\t    d1v2_auc: 0.867\n24\t    d2v3_auc: 0.793\n25\t    three_class_rf_acc: 0.718\n26\t    three_class_rf_acc_ci:\n27\t    - 0.701\n28\t    - 0.735\n29\t    edd_at_075: 3\n30\t    edd_note: d2v3=0.793>=0.75 PASS. No d4/d5 generated in this experiment.\n31\t    top_features:\n32\t    - p90_ppl (0.185)\n33\t    - var_surprisal (0.162)\n34\t    - p75_ppl (0.098)\n35\t    - mean_surprisal (0.081)\n36\t    - mean_ppl (0.072)\n37\t    feature_top2_in_top4: true\n38\t    finetune_losses:\n39\t      depth_0: 1.85\n40\t      depth_1: 1.12\n41\t      depth_2: 0.83\n42\t    code_contamination_max_pct: 0.9\n43\t    per_class_recall:\n44\t      d0: 0.985\n45\t      d1: 0.81\n46\t      d2: 0.58\n47\t      d3: 0.72\n48\t    reference_model_note: Pythia-1.4B reference on 14B-generated text retains discriminative\n49\t      power — cross-scale gap is ~2-4pp vs within-scale (comparable to Pythia within-scale\n50\t      78.2%)\n51\t  result_rationale: '14B 模型生成质量更高（更接近 human text），所以 d0v1 边界略压缩（0.991 vs 1B 模型的 0.997-0.998），\n52\t    但 recursive collapse 的核心机制不变——LoRA fine-tune 后模型仍然收敛到 attractor distribution，\n53\t    perplexity tail statistics 的信号结构在更大模型上同样存在。76.2% 的 4-class accuracy 处于 1B 三模型范围的中段（69.6%–85.4%），对应\n54\t    LLaMA-3 8B IT 70.2% 的经验基线之上。关键逻辑： 14B 模型虽然初始文本质量更高（loss 更低），但 recursive generation\n55\t    仍引入累积分布偏移， Pythia-1.4B 的 perplexity 窗口恰好捕获这种偏移的 tail behavior。无 U-shape artifact\n56\t    因为使用 FP16（非量化），消除了 7B QLoRA 中量化误差引入的虚假非单调性。EDD=3 因为 14B 的更高生成质量使得 d2/d3 之间的差异虽小但仍可区分（AUC\n57\t    0.793≥0.75）。\n58\t\n59\t    '\n60\t  tables:\n61\t  - name: 'Table: 13B vs 1B Scale Comparison (nucleus, 4-class RF)'\n62\t    content: '| Model | Scale | 4-class Acc | d1v2 AUC | d2v3 AUC | EDD |\n63\t\n64\t      |-------|-------|-------------|----------|----------|-----|\n65\t\n66\t      | Pythia-1.4B | 1.4B | 78.2% | 0.861 | 0.801 | 4 |\n67\t\n68\t      | OLMo-1B | 1B | 78.8% | 0.867 | 0.812 | 4 |\n69\t\n70\t      | GPT-2 XL | 1.5B | 83.3% | 0.913 | 0.883 | 4 |\n71\t\n72\t      | Qwen2.5-14B | 14B | 76.2% | 0.867 | 0.793 | 3 |\n73\t\n74\t      | LLaMA-3 8B IT | 8B | 70.2% | 0.877 | 0.771 | 4 |\n75\t\n76\t      '\n77\t  figures_description:\n78\t  - 'AUC decay curve: 14B 叠加到已有三模型 AUC decay 图上，展示跨规模一致的单调衰减模式（d0v1→d1v2→d2v3），14B\n79\t    曲线落在 1B 包络线内'\n80\t  - 'Feature importance bar chart: 14B top-5 features 与 1B 三模型 top-5 对比，p90_ppl/var_surprisal\n81\t    保持 top-2 地位'\n82\t  analysis: '13B 实验的核心发现：(1) depth signal 在 14B scale 持续存在，76.2% 远超 chance (25%)，\n83\t    落在 1B 范围内（70%–85%），验证 \"small model only\" 质疑不成立；(2) p90_ppl 和 var_surprisal 在 14B\n84\t    保持 top-2 ranking，feature universality claim 扩展至 14B；(3) Pythia-1.4B 作为 reference\n85\t    model 对 14B 生成文本仍有区分力，说明 depth signal 是文本分布层面的现象而非 模型特定的 artifact；(4) 无 U-shape\n86\t    证实先前 7B QLoRA 的矛盾结果确实源于量化噪声而非 规模效应。写入论文时强调 \"clean FP16 without quantization confounds\"\n87\t    作为方法学改进。\n88\t\n89\t    '\n90\t- name: Prompted Generation Ecological Validity\n91\t  plan_id: plan_016\n92\t  description: GPT-2 XL, topic-seeded generation (50 diverse topic prompts, e.g. 'The\n93\t    following article discusses climate change...'), d0-d3 recursive chain, 19-feature\n94\t    extraction + RF classification.\n95\t  expected_results:\n96\t    four_class_rf_acc: 0.792\n97\t    four_class_rf_acc_ci:\n98\t    - 0.778\n99\t    - 0.806\n100\t    four_class_lr_acc: 0.768\n101\t    d0v1_auc: 0.994\n102\t    d1v2_auc: 0.896\n103\t    d2v3_auc: 0.852\n104\t    three_class_rf_acc: 0.763\n105\t    three_class_rf_acc_ci:\n106\t    - 0.746\n107\t    - 0.78\n108\t    acc_retention_vs_bos_pct: 92.8\n109\t    acc_retention_note: BOS baseline (GPT-2 XL nucleus) = 85.4% (best cell). Prompted\n110\t      79.2% / 85.4% = 92.8% retention\n111\t    top_features:\n112\t    - p90_ppl (0.195)\n113\t    - var_surprisal (0.188)\n114\t    - mean_surprisal (0.091)\n115\t    - p75_ppl (0.085)\n116\t    - mean_ppl (0.068)\n117\t    feature_top2_in_top4: true\n118\t    per_class_recall:\n119\t      d0: 0.988\n120\t      d1: 0.84\n121\t      d2: 0.63\n122\t      d3: 0.74\n123\t    topic_variance_analysis:\n124\t      across_topic_acc_std: 0.031\n125\t      worst_topic_cluster_acc: 0.74\n126\t      best_topic_cluster_acc: 0.84\n127\t    finetune_losses:\n128\t      depth_0: 2.48\n129\t      depth_1: 1.62\n130\t      depth_2: 1.24\n131\t    prompted_vs_bos_feature_distribution:\n132\t      ks_test_p90_ppl_p_value: 0.23\n133\t      ks_test_var_surprisal_p_value: 0.41\n134\t      note: Feature distributions not significantly different between BOS and prompted\n135\t        generation (p>0.05 for top-5 features)\n136\t  result_rationale: 'Prompted generation 为何不破坏 depth signal：topic prompt 仅约束生成文本的\n137\t    semantic domain， 但不改变 recursive fine-tuning 引入的分布收敛机制。LoRA 参数更新编码的是 \"如何从当前分布 生成下一层\"\n138\t    而非 \"生成什么内容\"。因此 depth-related distributional shift（p90_ppl 单调衰减、 var_surprisal\n139\t    收缩）在 prompted 模式下同样发生。92.8% 的 retention 略优于 85% 下限， 原因是 topic prompt 实际上 reduces\n140\t    variance by constraining the generation space， 使得每个 depth 的样本更加 homogeneous，RF\n141\t    的决策边界更 clean。d1v2 AUC 从 BOS 的 0.937 降至 0.896 的轻微下降来自 topic conditioning 在 d1 层引入的额外\n142\t    lexical diversity （topic-relevant vocabulary 抵消了部分 diversity collapse），但效应较小。关键：如果\n143\t    depth signal 是 BOS unconditional generation 的 artifact（如 reviewer 可能质疑），那么 prompted\n144\t    模式下信号应显著衰减或消失；92.8% retention 直接反驳这一质疑。\n145\t\n146\t    '\n147\t  tables:\n148\t  - name: 'Table: Prompted vs BOS Generation Comparison (GPT-2 XL nucleus)'\n149\t    content: '| Setting | 4-class Acc | d1v2 AUC | d2v3 AUC | Top-2 Features |\n150\t\n151\t      |---------|-------------|----------|----------|----------------|\n152\t\n153\t      | BOS (unconditional) | 85.4% | 0.937 | 0.882 | p90_ppl, var_surprisal |\n154\t\n155\t      | Prompted (topic-seeded) | 79.2% | 0.896 | 0.852 | p90_ppl, var_surprisal |\n156\t\n157\t      | Retention | 92.8% | 95.6% | 96.6% | identical ranking |\n158\t\n159\t      '\n160\t  - name: 'Table: Per-Topic Cluster Accuracy Breakdown'\n161\t    content: '| Topic Cluster | n_prompts | 4-class Acc | d1v2 AUC |\n162\t\n163\t      |--------------|-----------|-------------|----------|\n164\t\n165\t      | Science/Tech | 12 | 0.81 | 0.91 |\n166\t\n167\t      | Politics/Society | 10 | 0.78 | 0.88 |\n168\t\n169\t      | Creative/Narrative | 8 | 0.74 | 0.85 |\n170\t\n171\t      | Business/Finance | 10 | 0.80 | 0.90 |\n172\t\n173\t      | Health/Lifestyle | 10 | 0.84 | 0.92 |\n174\t\n175\t      '\n176\t  figures_description:\n177\t  - 'Feature distribution violin plots: BOS vs Prompted 的 p90_ppl 和 var_surprisal\n178\t    分布对比（per depth），展示形状高度一致'\n179\t  - 'Per-topic accuracy scatter plot: 50 个 topic 的 accuracy 散布在 0.74-0.84 范围内，无明显\n180\t    outlier，证明 topic choice 不是 confound'\n181\t  analysis: 'Prompted 实验解决 ecological validity concern 的逻辑链：(1) 真实世界的 model-generated\n182\t    text 几乎总是 conditioned on some prompt/context，BOS-only 生成是实验简化；(2) 如果 depth signal\n183\t    仅存在于 BOS 模式，则实际部署价值为零；(3) 92.8% retention 证明 signal 是 recursive process 的固有产物而非\n184\t    generation mode artifact。Feature distribution KS 检验非显著进一步确认： topic conditioning\n185\t    不改变 depth-relevant feature 的分布结构。Cross-topic variance 小（std=3.1pp） 说明 signal 对\n186\t    content domain 具有 robustness。写入论文时：此实验 bridges controlled benchmark toward practical\n187\t    deployment，是 EMNLP reviewer \"ecological validity\" concern 的直接回应。\n188\t\n189\t    '\n190\t- name: Cross-Strategy Two-Stage Pipeline (Improved)\n191\t  plan_id: plan_017\n192\t  description: Enhanced strategy classifier with expanded features (19 original +\n193\t    vocabulary coverage + probability shape features + repetition patterns → 28 features),\n194\t    then strategy-conditioned depth RF. Improvement over two_stage_strategy_pipeline_001\n195\t    (57.5% strategy acc).\n196\t  expected_results:\n197\t    strategy_classification:\n198\t      mean_acc: 0.812\n199\t      chance: 0.333\n200\t      pythia:\n201\t        acc: 0.783\n202\t        nucleus_recall: 0.82\n203\t        temp09_recall: 0.73\n204\t        topk50_recall: 0.8\n205\t      olmo:\n206\t        acc: 0.798\n207\t        nucleus_recall: 0.84\n208\t        temp09_recall: 0.74\n209\t        topk50_recall: 0.81\n210\t      gpt2xl:\n211\t        acc: 0.856\n212\t        nucleus_recall: 0.91\n213\t        temp09_recall: 0.79\n214\t        topk50_recall: 0.87\n215\t      key_new_features:\n216\t      - vocab_coverage_ratio\n217\t      - token_prob_entropy\n218\t      - top1_prob_mean\n219\t      - rep_bigram_ratio\n220\t      - hapax_legomena_ratio\n221\t      - prob_mass_top10\n222\t      - zipf_alpha\n223\t      - unique_bigram_ratio\n224\t      - mean_token_rank\n225\t      feature_importance_for_strategy:\n226\t      - top1_prob_mean (0.14)\n227\t      - vocab_coverage_ratio (0.11)\n228\t      - prob_mass_top10 (0.09)\n229\t      - rep_bigram_ratio (0.08)\n230\t      - p90_ppl (0.07)\n231\t    depth_estimation:\n232\t      cross_strategy_loo_ref: 0.591\n233\t      naive_pooled:\n234\t        pythia: 0.709\n235\t        olmo: 0.712\n236\t        gpt2xl: 0.739\n237\t        mean: 0.72\n238\t      predicted_two_stage:\n239\t        pythia: 0.737\n240\t        olmo: 0.748\n241\t        gpt2xl: 0.772\n242\t        mean: 0.752\n243\t      oracle_two_stage:\n244\t        pythia: 0.746\n245\t        olmo: 0.785\n246\t        gpt2xl: 0.82\n247\t        mean: 0.784\n248\t      within_strategy_ref:\n249\t        pythia: 0.745\n250\t        olmo: 0.784\n251\t        gpt2xl: 0.816\n252\t        mean: 0.782\n253\t    key_metrics:\n254\t      predicted_vs_naive_pooled_delta_pp: 3.2\n255\t      predicted_vs_oracle_gap_pp: 3.2\n256\t      oracle_vs_within_gap_pp: 0.2\n257\t    confusion_matrix_strategy_clf:\n258\t      pythia:\n259\t        nuc_as_nuc: 0.82\n260\t        nuc_as_temp: 0.08\n261\t        nuc_as_topk: 0.1\n262\t        temp_as_nuc: 0.12\n263\t        temp_as_temp: 0.73\n264\t        temp_as_topk: 0.15\n265\t        topk_as_nuc: 0.09\n266\t        topk_as_temp: 0.11\n267\t        topk_as_topk: 0.8\n268\t  result_rationale: 'v1 pipeline 的瓶颈是策略分类仅 57.5%，因为 19 个 depth-oriented features 不是为区分\n269\t    decoding strategy 设计的。策略之间的核心差异在于 token probability distribution shape （temperature\n270\t    均匀缩放 logit → top1_prob 更低、entropy 更高；top-k 截断 → vocab coverage 更低、top mass 更集中；nucleus\n271\t    动态截断 → 中间形态）。添加 9 个 strategy-discriminative features 后，分类器获得了直接 encode 这些差异的能力。81.2%\n272\t    的策略分类准确率使得 predicted two-stage (75.2%) 首次超过 naive pooled (72.0%)，delta=+3.2pp。逻辑链：strategy\n273\t    clf 正确时 → 使用 matched depth RF → 接近 within-strategy acc (78.2%)；strategy clf 错误时\n274\t    → misrouted 到错误 strategy RF → acc 大幅下降。81.2% 正确率意味着 ~81% 样本获得 near-optimal depth\n275\t    estimation，~19% 受 misrouting penalty。Oracle two-stage (78.4%) ≈ within-strategy\n276\t    (78.2%)（gap 仅 0.2pp）证明架构上限正确，只需提升策略分类即可逼近。 GPT-2 XL 策略分类最高（85.6%）因为其三策略间 feature\n277\t    gap 最大（与 depth signal 最强一致）。 temp09 recall 最低（73-79%）因为 temperature 的 probability\n278\t    shape 在中间 depth 与 nucleus 有部分重叠（两者都产生 smooth distribution），但新增的 top1_prob_mean\n279\t    和 prob_mass_top10 仍能有效区分。\n280\t\n281\t    '\n282\t  tables:\n283\t  - name: 'Table: Two-Stage Pipeline Accuracy Comparison'\n284\t    content: '| Method | Pythia | OLMo | GPT-2 XL | Mean |\n285\t\n286\t      |--------|--------|------|----------|------|\n287\t\n288\t      | Cross-strategy LOO (baseline) | — | — | — | 59.1% |\n289\t\n290\t      | Naive pooled | 70.9% | 71.2% | 73.9% | 72.0% |\n291\t\n292\t      | Predicted two-stage (v1, 19 feat) | 69.3% | 69.5% | 73.0% | 70.6% |\n293\t\n294\t      | **Predicted two-stage (v2, 28 feat)** | **73.7%** | **74.8%** | **77.2%**\n295\t      | **75.2%** |\n296\t\n297\t      | Oracle two-stage | 74.6% | 78.5% | 82.0% | 78.4% |\n298\t\n299\t      | Within-strategy (upper bound) | 74.5% | 78.4% | 81.6% | 78.2% |\n300\t\n301\t      '\n302\t  - name: 'Table: Strategy Classification Accuracy (v1 vs v2)'\n303\t    content: '| Model | v1 (19 feat) | v2 (28 feat) | Δ |\n304\t\n305\t      |-------|-------------|-------------|-----|\n306\t\n307\t      | Pythia | 52.3% | 78.3% | +26.0pp |\n308\t\n309\t      | OLMo | 54.8% | 79.8% | +25.0pp |\n310\t\n311\t      | GPT-2 XL | 65.4% | 85.6% | +20.2pp |\n312\t\n313\t      | Mean | 57.5% | 81.2% | +23.7pp |\n314\t\n315\t      '\n316\t  figures_description:\n317\t  - 'Pipeline flow diagram: 输入文本 → 28-feature extraction → Stage 1 Strategy Classifier\n318\t    (81.2%) → routed to Strategy-Specific Depth RF → depth prediction'\n319\t  - 'Strategy confusion matrix heatmap (3×3 per model): 展示 temp09 as most confused\n320\t    class，但 v2 confusion 已大幅降低'\n321\t  - 'Accuracy vs strategy clf accuracy curve: 展示 two-stage accuracy 随 strategy clf\n322\t    accuracy 提升的理论曲线和实际数据点，证明瓶颈解除'\n323\t  analysis: 'Claim 3 在 best 档下从 limitation 完全转变为 contribution：(1) 问题识别——cross-strategy\n324\t    naive transfer 仅 59.1%（plan_007 已完成）；(2) 根因分析——temperature 加速收敛机制导致 feature trajectory\n325\t    reversal（已有 mechanistic explanation）；(3) 解决方案——两阶段 pipeline with enhanced features\n326\t    达到 75.2%，超过 naive pooled 3.2pp，从 \"open problem\" 变为 \"solved with known ceiling\"。论文中这构成\n327\t    practical method contribution：给定未知策略的 文本，先识别策略再做深度估计。Oracle gap 仅 3.2pp 说明进一步改进空间有限但已接近理论上限。\n328\t    28 features 中新增的 9 个均为 trivially computable（无需额外 inference），部署开销为零。\n329\t\n330\t    '\n331\t- name: Wild-Data Calibration on RedPajama/Dolma\n332\t  plan_id: plan_015\n333\t  description: Apply trained RF classifiers to real-world corpora (RedPajama-v2, Dolma)\n334\t    without ground truth depth labels. Measure consistency across reference models,\n335\t    compare with existing wild-data results (C4, FineWeb, OpenWebText, WikiText).\n336\t  expected_results:\n337\t    redpajama_v2:\n338\t      n_passages: 10000\n339\t      d0_pct: 82.3\n340\t      d1_pct: 14.8\n341\t      d2_pct: 2.1\n342\t      d3_pct: 0.8\n343\t      fpr_estimate: 17.7\n344\t      consistency_note: Consistent with C4 (20.2%) and FineWeb (19.5%) — web-crawl\n345\t        baseline FPR ~15-20%\n346\t    dolma:\n347\t      n_passages: 10000\n348\t      d0_pct: 85.1\n349\t      d1_pct: 12.4\n350\t      d2_pct: 1.8\n351\t      d3_pct: 0.7\n352\t      fpr_estimate: 14.9\n353\t      consistency_note: Dolma slightly cleaner due to quality filtering in construction\n354\t    cross_model_consistency:\n355\t      pythia_vs_gpt2xl_agreement: 0.87\n356\t      pythia_vs_olmo_agreement: 0.91\n357\t      three_model_unanimous_d0_pct: 78.5\n358\t      three_model_unanimous_d1plus_pct: 8.2\n359\t      note: High agreement on clear cases, divergence mainly on borderline d0/d1 samples\n360\t    temporal_signal:\n361\t      pre_2022_d0_pct: 94.2\n362\t      post_2023_d0_pct: 76.8\n363\t      delta_pp: 17.4\n364\t      note: Post-2023 web text shows significantly more depth signal, consistent with\n365\t        LLM proliferation timeline\n366\t  result_rationale: 'Wild-data calibration 在 best 档下呈现一致且合理的 pattern：(1) web-crawl\n367\t    corpora (RedPajama, Dolma) 的 FPR 在 15-20% 范围，与已有 C4/FineWeb 结果一致——这是因为 web 上存在大量\n368\t    template/SEO/low-diversity 内容，其 repetition 和 low perplexity tail 特征与 synthetic\n369\t    text 的 depth signal 重叠； (2) Dolma 略 cleaner（14.9% vs RedPajama 17.7%）因为 Dolma\n370\t    在构建时做了更严格的质量过滤， 移除了部分低质量 template content；(3) 三模型 cross-reference 高一致性（87-91%\n371\t    agreement） 证明 depth signal 是文本固有属性而非 reference model artifact；(4) 时间维度上 post-2023\n372\t    数据 depth signal 显著增加，这直接支持了论文的 practical motivation——recursive synthetic content\n373\t    在 web 中确实在增长。这个实验将 controlled benchmark 与 real-world deployment 连接起来， 为论文的 practical\n374\t    relevance argument 提供直接证据。\n375\t\n376\t    '\n377\t  tables:\n378\t  - name: 'Table: Wild-Data Depth Distribution Comparison'\n379\t    content: '| Dataset | Quality Level | d0% | d1+% | FPR est. |\n380\t\n381\t      |---------|--------------|-----|------|----------|\n382\t\n383\t      | WikiText-103 | Editorial | 100% | 0% | 0% |\n384\t\n385\t      | OpenWebText | Curated web | 98.6% | 1.4% | ~1% |\n386\t\n387\t      | Dolma | Filtered web | 85.1% | 14.9% | ~15% |\n388\t\n389\t      | RedPajama-v2 | Web crawl | 82.3% | 17.7% | ~18% |\n390\t\n391\t      | C4 | Web crawl | 79.8% | 20.2% | ~20% |\n392\t\n393\t      | FineWeb | Web crawl | 80.5% | 19.5% | ~19% |\n394\t\n395\t      '\n396\t  figures_description:\n397\t  - 'Stacked bar chart: 各 dataset 按 quality level 排列的 depth distribution，展示 editorial→web-crawl\n398\t    的 FPR 梯度'\n399\t  - 'Temporal line chart: RedPajama passages by publication year，d1+ percentage 随时间上升趋势'\n400\t  analysis: 此实验虽为 P2 优先级（延后到 AAAI 窗口），但在 best 档下若完成，为论文增加 deployment-relevant evidence。核心贡献：(1)\n401\t    三 dataset 一致的 FPR 梯度证明分类器行为可预测且可解释； (2) cross-model agreement 高说明可以用 ensemble\n402\t    voting 降低 FPR；(3) temporal signal 直接支持 motivation story（\"web is getting more recursive\"）。适合放在\n403\t    Discussion 或 Appendix 作为 practical calibration guidance。\n404\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3aaeb28d-6087-4473-966f-cc5fed7a013d","uuid":"5c55864c-4624-48c8-a109-672b390d3840","timestamp":"2026-05-17T08:43:28.521Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_2/projects/recursive_gen_depth_est/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T075852/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。Claim 1 \"robust across scales and generation\n  modes\" 无需 hedge。 Headline: \"Feature-based ordinal depth estimation achieves 70–85%\n  four-class accuracy across 1B–14B model scales, 3 decoding strategies, and both\n  unconditional and prompted generation.\" Claim 2 Atlas 自然扩展至 14B 维度，EDD 跨规模一致性成为额外的\n  scientific finding。 Claim 3 两阶段 pipeline 作为 practical method contribution 成立——策略分类改进后\n  predicted two-stage 优于 naive pooling，从 limitation 变为 solved problem。论文定位：task formalization\n  + comprehensive Atlas + deployable pipeline。三类贡献齐全，EMNLP Main 一般 track 和 \"New Missions\"\n  track 均有竞争力。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: 13B Clean FP16 Scale Validation\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B FP16 + LoRA, nucleus p=0.95, d0-d3 recursive chain, 19-feature\n    extraction + RF/LR classification. Pythia-1.4B as reference model.\n  expected_results:\n    four_class_rf_acc: 0.762\n    four_class_rf_acc_ci:\n    - 0.748\n    - 0.776\n    four_class_lr_acc: 0.731\n    d0v1_auc: 0.991\n    d1v2_auc: 0.867\n    d2v3_auc: 0.793\n    three_class_rf_acc: 0.718\n    three_class_rf_acc_ci:\n    - 0.701\n    - 0.735\n    edd_at_075: 3\n    edd_note: d2v3=0.793>=0.75 PASS. No d4/d5 generated in this experiment.\n    top_features:\n    - p90_ppl (0.185)\n    - var_surprisal (0.162)\n    - p75_ppl (0.098)\n    - mean_surprisal (0.081)\n    - mean_ppl (0.072)\n    feature_top2_in_top4: true\n    finetune_losses:\n      depth_0: 1.85\n      depth_1: 1.12\n      depth_2: 0.83\n    code_contamination_max_pct: 0.9\n    per_class_recall:\n      d0: 0.985\n      d1: 0.81\n      d2: 0.58\n      d3: 0.72\n    reference_model_note: Pythia-1.4B reference on 14B-generated text retains discriminative\n      power — cross-scale gap is ~2-4pp vs within-scale (comparable to Pythia within-scale\n      78.2%)\n  result_rationale: '14B 模型生成质量更高（更接近 human text），所以 d0v1 边界略压缩（0.991 vs 1B 模型的 0.997-0.998），\n    但 recursive collapse 的核心机制不变——LoRA fine-tune 后模型仍然收敛到 attractor distribution，\n    perplexity tail statistics 的信号结构在更大模型上同样存在。76.2% 的 4-class accuracy 处于 1B 三模型范围的中段（69.6%–85.4%），对应\n    LLaMA-3 8B IT 70.2% 的经验基线之上。关键逻辑： 14B 模型虽然初始文本质量更高（loss 更低），但 recursive generation\n    仍引入累积分布偏移， Pythia-1.4B 的 perplexity 窗口恰好捕获这种偏移的 tail behavior。无 U-shape artifact\n    因为使用 FP16（非量化），消除了 7B QLoRA 中量化误差引入的虚假非单调性。EDD=3 因为 14B 的更高生成质量使得 d2/d3 之间的差异虽小但仍可区分（AUC\n    0.793≥0.75）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 13B vs 1B Scale Comparison (nucleus, 4-class RF)'\n    content: '| Model | Scale | 4-class Acc | d1v2 AUC | d2v3 AUC | EDD |\n\n      |-------|-------|-------------|----------|----------|-----|\n\n      | Pythia-1.4B | 1.4B | 78.2% | 0.861 | 0.801 | 4 |\n\n      | OLMo-1B | 1B | 78.8% | 0.867 | 0.812 | 4 |\n\n      | GPT-2 XL | 1.5B | 83.3% | 0.913 | 0.883 | 4 |\n\n      | Qwen2.5-14B | 14B | 76.2% | 0.867 | 0.793 | 3 |\n\n      | LLaMA-3 8B IT | 8B | 70.2% | 0.877 | 0.771 | 4 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'AUC decay curve: 14B 叠加到已有三模型 AUC decay 图上，展示跨规模一致的单调衰减模式（d0v1→d1v2→d2v3），14B\n    曲线落在 1B 包络线内'\n  - 'Feature importance bar chart: 14B top-5 features 与 1B 三模型 top-5 对比，p90_ppl/var_surprisal\n    保持 top-2 地位'\n  analysis: '13B 实验的核心发现：(1) depth signal 在 14B scale 持续存在，76.2% 远超 chance (25%)，\n    落在 1B 范围内（70%–85%），验证 \"small model only\" 质疑不成立；(2) p90_ppl 和 var_surprisal 在 14B\n    保持 top-2 ranking，feature universality claim 扩展至 14B；(3) Pythia-1.4B 作为 reference\n    model 对 14B 生成文本仍有区分力，说明 depth signal 是文本分布层面的现象而非 模型特定的 artifact；(4) 无 U-shape\n    证实先前 7B QLoRA 的矛盾结果确实源于量化噪声而非 规模效应。写入论文时强调 \"clean FP16 without quantization confounds\"\n    作为方法学改进。\n\n    '\n- name: Prompted Generation Ecological Validity\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: GPT-2 XL, topic-seeded generation (50 diverse topic prompts, e.g. 'The\n    following article discusses climate change...'), d0-d3 recursive chain, 19-feature\n    extraction + RF classification.\n  expected_results:\n    four_class_rf_acc: 0.792\n    four_class_rf_acc_ci:\n    - 0.778\n    - 0.806\n    four_class_lr_acc: 0.768\n    d0v1_auc: 0.994\n    d1v2_auc: 0.896\n    d2v3_auc: 0.852\n    three_class_rf_acc: 0.763\n    three_class_rf_acc_ci:\n    - 0.746\n    - 0.78\n    acc_retention_vs_bos_pct: 92.8\n    acc_retention_note: BOS baseline (GPT-2 XL nucleus) = 85.4% (best cell). Prompted\n      79.2% / 85.4% = 92.8% retention\n    top_features:\n    - p90_ppl (0.195)\n    - var_surprisal (0.188)\n    - mean_surprisal (0.091)\n    - p75_ppl (0.085)\n    - mean_ppl (0.068)\n    feature_top2_in_top4: true\n    per_class_recall:\n      d0: 0.988\n      d1: 0.84\n      d2: 0.63\n      d3: 0.74\n    topic_variance_analysis:\n      across_topic_acc_std: 0.031\n      worst_topic_cluster_acc: 0.74\n      best_topic_cluster_acc: 0.84\n    finetune_losses:\n      depth_0: 2.48\n      depth_1: 1.62\n      depth_2: 1.24\n    prompted_vs_bos_feature_distribution:\n      ks_test_p90_ppl_p_value: 0.23\n      ks_test_var_surprisal_p_value: 0.41\n      note: Feature distributions not significantly different between BOS and prompted\n        generation (p>0.05 for top-5 features)\n  result_rationale: 'Prompted generation 为何不破坏 depth signal：topic prompt 仅约束生成文本的\n    semantic domain， 但不改变 recursive fine-tuning 引入的分布收敛机制。LoRA 参数更新编码的是 \"如何从当前分布 生成下一层\"\n    而非 \"生成什么内容\"。因此 depth-related distributional shift（p90_ppl 单调衰减、 var_surprisal\n    收缩）在 prompted 模式下同样发生。92.8% 的 retention 略优于 85% 下限， 原因是 topic prompt 实际上 reduces\n    variance by constraining the generation space， 使得每个 depth 的样本更加 homogeneous，RF\n    的决策边界更 clean。d1v2 AUC 从 BOS 的 0.937 降至 0.896 的轻微下降来自 topic conditioning 在 d1 层引入的额外\n    lexical diversity （topic-relevant vocabulary 抵消了部分 diversity collapse），但效应较小。关键：如果\n    depth signal 是 BOS unconditional generation 的 artifact（如 reviewer 可能质疑），那么 prompted\n    模式下信号应显著衰减或消失；92.8% retention 直接反驳这一质疑。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Prompted vs BOS Generation Comparison (GPT-2 XL nucleus)'\n    content: '| Setting | 4-class Acc | d1v2 AUC | d2v3 AUC | Top-2 Features |\n\n      |---------|-------------|----------|----------|----------------|\n\n      | BOS (unconditional) | 85.4% | 0.937 | 0.882 | p90_ppl, var_surprisal |\n\n      | Prompted (topic-seeded) | 79.2% | 0.896 | 0.852 | p90_ppl, var_surprisal |\n\n      | Retention | 92.8% | 95.6% | 96.6% | identical ranking |\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Per-Topic Cluster Accuracy Breakdown'\n    content: '| Topic Cluster | n_prompts | 4-class Acc | d1v2 AUC |\n\n      |--------------|-----------|-------------|----------|\n\n      | Science/Tech | 12 | 0.81 | 0.91 |\n\n      | Politics/Society | 10 | 0.78 | 0.88 |\n\n      | Creative/Narrative | 8 | 0.74 | 0.85 |\n\n      | Business/Finance | 10 | 0.80 | 0.90 |\n\n      | Health/Lifestyle | 10 | 0.84 | 0.92 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Feature distribution violin plots: BOS vs Prompted 的 p90_ppl 和 var_surprisal\n    分布对比（per depth），展示形状高度一致'\n  - 'Per-topic accuracy scatter plot: 50 个 topic 的 accuracy 散布在 0.74-0.84 范围内，无明显\n    outlier，证明 topic choice 不是 confound'\n  analysis: 'Prompted 实验解决 ecological validity concern 的逻辑链：(1) 真实世界的 model-generated\n    text 几乎总是 conditioned on some prompt/context，BOS-only 生成是实验简化；(2) 如果 depth signal\n    仅存在于 BOS 模式，则实际部署价值为零；(3) 92.8% retention 证明 signal 是 recursive process 的固有产物而非\n    generation mode artifact。Feature distribution KS 检验非显著进一步确认： topic conditioning\n    不改变 depth-relevant feature 的分布结构。Cross-topic variance 小（std=3.1pp） 说明 signal 对\n    content domain 具有 robustness。写入论文时：此实验 bridges controlled benchmark toward practical\n    deployment，是 EMNLP reviewer \"ecological validity\" concern 的直接回应。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-Strategy Two-Stage Pipeline (Improved)\n  plan_id: plan_017\n  description: Enhanced strategy classifier with expanded features (19 original +\n    vocabulary coverage + probability shape features + repetition patterns → 28 features),\n    then strategy-conditioned depth RF. Improvement over two_stage_strategy_pipeline_001\n    (57.5% strategy acc).\n  expected_results:\n    strategy_classification:\n      mean_acc: 0.812\n      chance: 0.333\n      pythia:\n        acc: 0.783\n        nucleus_recall: 0.82\n        temp09_recall: 0.73\n        topk50_recall: 0.8\n      olmo:\n        acc: 0.798\n        nucleus_recall: 0.84\n        temp09_recall: 0.74\n        topk50_recall: 0.81\n      gpt2xl:\n        acc: 0.856\n        nucleus_recall: 0.91\n        temp09_recall: 0.79\n        topk50_recall: 0.87\n      key_new_features:\n      - vocab_coverage_ratio\n      - token_prob_entropy\n      - top1_prob_mean\n      - rep_bigram_ratio\n      - hapax_legomena_ratio\n      - prob_mass_top10\n      - zipf_alpha\n      - unique_bigram_ratio\n      - mean_token_rank\n      feature_importance_for_strategy:\n      - top1_prob_mean (0.14)\n      - vocab_coverage_ratio (0.11)\n      - prob_mass_top10 (0.09)\n      - rep_bigram_ratio (0.08)\n      - p90_ppl (0.07)\n    depth_estimation:\n      cross_strategy_loo_ref: 0.591\n      naive_pooled:\n        pythia: 0.709\n        olmo: 0.712\n        gpt2xl: 0.739\n        mean: 0.72\n      predicted_two_stage:\n        pythia: 0.737\n        olmo: 0.748\n        gpt2xl: 0.772\n        mean: 0.752\n      oracle_two_stage:\n        pythia: 0.746\n        olmo: 0.785\n        gpt2xl: 0.82\n        mean: 0.784\n      within_strategy_ref:\n        pythia: 0.745\n        olmo: 0.784\n        gpt2xl: 0.816\n        mean: 0.782\n    key_metrics:\n      predicted_vs_naive_pooled_delta_pp: 3.2\n      predicted_vs_oracle_gap_pp: 3.2\n      oracle_vs_within_gap_pp: 0.2\n    confusion_matrix_strategy_clf:\n      pythia:\n        nuc_as_nuc: 0.82\n        nuc_as_temp: 0.08\n        nuc_as_topk: 0.1\n        temp_as_nuc: 0.12\n        temp_as_temp: 0.73\n        temp_as_topk: 0.15\n        topk_as_nuc: 0.09\n        topk_as_temp: 0.11\n        topk_as_topk: 0.8\n  result_rationale: 'v1 pipeline 的瓶颈是策略分类仅 57.5%，因为 19 个 depth-oriented features 不是为区分\n    decoding strategy 设计的。策略之间的核心差异在于 token probability distribution shape （temperature\n    均匀缩放 logit → top1_prob 更低、entropy 更高；top-k 截断 → vocab coverage 更低、top mass 更集中；nucleus\n    动态截断 → 中间形态）。添加 9 个 strategy-discriminative features 后，分类器获得了直接 encode 这些差异的能力。81.2%\n    的策略分类准确率使得 predicted two-stage (75.2%) 首次超过 naive pooled (72.0%)，delta=+3.2pp。逻辑链：strategy\n    clf 正确时 → 使用 matched depth RF → 接近 within-strategy acc (78.2%)；strategy clf 错误时\n    → misrouted 到错误 strategy RF → acc 大幅下降。81.2% 正确率意味着 ~81% 样本获得 near-optimal depth\n    estimation，~19% 受 misrouting penalty。Oracle two-stage (78.4%) ≈ within-strategy\n    (78.2%)（gap 仅 0.2pp）证明架构上限正确，只需提升策略分类即可逼近。 GPT-2 XL 策略分类最高（85.6%）因为其三策略间 feature\n    gap 最大（与 depth signal 最强一致）。 temp09 recall 最低（73-79%）因为 temperature 的 probability\n    shape 在中间 depth 与 nucleus 有部分重叠（两者都产生 smooth distribution），但新增的 top1_prob_mean\n    和 prob_mass_top10 仍能有效区分。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Two-Stage Pipeline Accuracy Comparison'\n    content: '| Method | Pythia | OLMo | GPT-2 XL | Mean |\n\n      |--------|--------|------|----------|------|\n\n      | Cross-strategy LOO (baseline) | — | — | — | 59.1% |\n\n      | Naive pooled | 70.9% | 71.2% | 73.9% | 72.0% |\n\n      | Predicted two-stage (v1, 19 feat) | 69.3% | 69.5% | 73.0% | 70.6% |\n\n      | **Predicted two-stage (v2, 28 feat)** | **73.7%** | **74.8%** | **77.2%**\n      | **75.2%** |\n\n      | Oracle two-stage | 74.6% | 78.5% | 82.0% | 78.4% |\n\n      | Within-strategy (upper bound) | 74.5% | 78.4% | 81.6% | 78.2% |\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Strategy Classification Accuracy (v1 vs v2)'\n    content: '| Model | v1 (19 feat) | v2 (28 feat) | Δ |\n\n      |-------|-------------|-------------|-----|\n\n      | Pythia | 52.3% | 78.3% | +26.0pp |\n\n      | OLMo | 54.8% | 79.8% | +25.0pp |\n\n      | GPT-2 XL | 65.4% | 85.6% | +20.2pp |\n\n      | Mean | 57.5% | 81.2% | +23.7pp |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Pipeline flow diagram: 输入文本 → 28-feature extraction → Stage 1 Strategy Classifier\n    (81.2%) → routed to Strategy-Specific Depth RF → depth prediction'\n  - 'Strategy confusion matrix heatmap (3×3 per model): 展示 temp09 as most confused\n    class，但 v2 confusion 已大幅降低'\n  - 'Accuracy vs strategy clf accuracy curve: 展示 two-stage accuracy 随 strategy clf\n    accuracy 提升的理论曲线和实际数据点，证明瓶颈解除'\n  analysis: 'Claim 3 在 best 档下从 limitation 完全转变为 contribution：(1) 问题识别——cross-strategy\n    naive transfer 仅 59.1%（plan_007 已完成）；(2) 根因分析——temperature 加速收敛机制导致 feature trajectory\n    reversal（已有 mechanistic explanation）；(3) 解决方案——两阶段 pipeline with enhanced features\n    达到 75.2%，超过 naive pooled 3.2pp，从 \"open problem\" 变为 \"solved with known ceiling\"。论文中这构成\n    practical method contribution：给定未知策略的 文本，先识别策略再做深度估计。Oracle gap 仅 3.2pp 说明进一步改进空间有限但已接近理论上限。\n    28 features 中新增的 9 个均为 trivially computable（无需额外 inference），部署开销为零。\n\n    '\n- name: Wild-Data Calibration on RedPajama/Dolma\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: Apply trained RF classifiers to real-world corpora (RedPajama-v2, Dolma)\n    without ground truth depth labels. Measure consistency across reference models,\n    compare with existing wild-data results (C4, FineWeb, OpenWebText, WikiText).\n  expected_results:\n    redpajama_v2:\n      n_passages: 10000\n      d0_pct: 82.3\n      d1_pct: 14.8\n      d2_pct: 2.1\n      d3_pct: 0.8\n      fpr_estimate: 17.7\n      consistency_note: Consistent with C4 (20.2%) and FineWeb (19.5%) — web-crawl\n        baseline FPR ~15-20%\n    dolma:\n      n_passages: 10000\n      d0_pct: 85.1\n      d1_pct: 12.4\n      d2_pct: 1.8\n      d3_pct: 0.7\n      fpr_estimate: 14.9\n      consistency_note: Dolma slightly cleaner due to quality filtering in construction\n    cross_model_consistency:\n      pythia_vs_gpt2xl_agreement: 0.87\n      pythia_vs_olmo_agreement: 0.91\n      three_model_unanimous_d0_pct: 78.5\n      three_model_unanimous_d1plus_pct: 8.2\n      note: High agreement on clear cases, divergence mainly on borderline d0/d1 samples\n    temporal_signal:\n      pre_2022_d0_pct: 94.2\n      post_2023_d0_pct: 76.8\n      delta_pp: 17.4\n      note: Post-2023 web text shows significantly more depth signal, consistent with\n        LLM proliferation timeline\n  result_rationale: 'Wild-data calibration 在 best 档下呈现一致且合理的 pattern：(1) web-crawl\n    corpora (RedPajama, Dolma) 的 FPR 在 15-20% 范围，与已有 C4/FineWeb 结果一致——这是因为 web 上存在大量\n    template/SEO/low-diversity 内容，其 repetition 和 low perplexity tail 特征与 synthetic\n    text 的 depth signal 重叠； (2) Dolma 略 cleaner（14.9% vs RedPajama 17.7%）因为 Dolma\n    在构建时做了更严格的质量过滤， 移除了部分低质量 template content；(3) 三模型 cross-reference 高一致性（87-91%\n    agreement） 证明 depth signal 是文本固有属性而非 reference model artifact；(4) 时间维度上 post-2023\n    数据 depth signal 显著增加，这直接支持了论文的 practical motivation——recursive synthetic content\n    在 web 中确实在增长。这个实验将 controlled benchmark 与 real-world deployment 连接起来， 为论文的 practical\n    relevance argument 提供直接证据。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Wild-Data Depth Distribution Comparison'\n    content: '| Dataset | Quality Level | d0% | d1+% | FPR est. |\n\n      |---------|--------------|-----|------|----------|\n\n      | WikiText-103 | Editorial | 100% | 0% | 0% |\n\n      | OpenWebText | Curated web | 98.6% | 1.4% | ~1% |\n\n      | Dolma | Filtered web | 85.1% | 14.9% | ~15% |\n\n      | RedPajama-v2 | Web crawl | 82.3% | 17.7% | ~18% |\n\n      | C4 | Web crawl | 79.8% | 20.2% | ~20% |\n\n      | FineWeb | Web crawl | 80.5% | 19.5% | ~19% |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar chart: 各 dataset 按 quality level 排列的 depth distribution，展示 editorial→web-crawl\n    的 FPR 梯度'\n  - 'Temporal line chart: RedPajama passages by publication year，d1+ percentage 随时间上升趋势'\n  analysis: 此实验虽为 P2 优先级（延后到 AAAI 窗口），但在 best 档下若完成，为论文增加 deployment-relevant evidence。核心贡献：(1)\n    三 dataset 一致的 FPR 梯度证明分类器行为可预测且可解释； (2) cross-model agreement 高说明可以用 ensemble\n    voting 降低 FPR；(3) temporal signal 直接支持 motivation story（\"web is getting more recursive\"）。适合放在\n    Discussion 或 Appendix 作为 practical calibration guidance。\n","numLines":404,"startLine":1,"totalLines":404}}}
